4. Emoji / Fonts / GIF SDK
---------------------------
- Emoji codePoints in EmojiKeyboardView.java are raw Unicode scalar values
  (public domain code points). No Noto Color Emoji font file is bundled in
  Phase 1; if added later, its license (Apache 2.0 / SIL OFL) will be added here.
- Google Fonts (Phase 2) — each font ships under its own SIL OFL / Apache 2.0;
  attribution will be appended per font when enabled.
- GIF/sticker SDK (Phase 3) — provider not yet chosen; row will be added before use.

